  "sourceTitle": "Pico De Gallo",
  "sourceText": "Pico De Gallo\nBy: Soni Khadilkar\nPublished: Monday, January 4, 2010 - 1:18am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups tomatoes\n1/4 cup onion\n2 jalapeños\n1 clove garlic\n1 lime (juice)\n1 handful coriander\nsalt and pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Chop tomato's, onions, garlic, coriander, jalapeños 2 Add juice of lime, salt and pepper to taste 3 Serve chilled.\n\nAbout\n\n\nMexican",
